{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "594601e89ce7e6efebc9e00822868561735f7c2bf24f7cc647ac823ce7e1cd7c", "ja": "（年越しライブで、山頂にある神社に来た。\n後は下山だけだが……亜利沙の体力は大丈夫だろうか）", "zh": "（由于跨年演唱会，我们来到位于山顶的神社。\n接下来只需要下山……但不晓得亚利沙的体力行不行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "2b909747ea10523b3ffe547eaa54167b189b002736b95a8f379f4cc69586546d", "ja": "むふふ……新春早々に撮った、アイドルちゃんたちの\nお宝写真！　どのショットも尊い、尊すぎますーっ！", "zh": "呵呵呵……刚过新年马上就拍到偶像宝贝的珍贵照片！\n每一张都好神圣，太神圣了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fe13cb349c6a39d201fdf714f4a2e531fc69f2f17e5969a9477119db6bee62ae", "ja": "……思った以上に元気そうだな。\n亜利沙、下山する体力は残っているか？", "zh": "……你比我想像中的还要有活力呢。\n亚利沙，你还有体力下山吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "c95d5f89feae9953345b0b7e3bc083e6175b15abc72a713caeda2e5d42e21d55", "ja": "ううっ！　正直に告白すると、ありさ、けっこう……\nさっきから、足が悲鳴を上げて……。", "zh": "呜呜！老实说，亚利沙其实……\n从刚才开始，两腿就酸痛到不行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "1b61e6c5899b4c2843ec2303e9b9f586d3a9bf1c691ee710edcc77788ca29805", "ja": "ですが、ありさは倒れませんよ！　アイドルちゃんの\n写真があれば、ありさはどこまでだって歩けます！", "zh": "可是，亚利沙是不会倒下的！只要有偶像宝贝的照片，\n就算要跋涉千里也难不倒亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f55767f542ae249e55fdca6b3820185af99e1aee171b1ae789f84b5b617b8f2f", "ja": "そんなに無理をしなくても大丈夫だぞ。\nもうちょっと、ここで休んでから下山しようか。", "zh": "你用不着这么勉强自己。\n我们就在这边休息一下，等会再下山吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "30cc26a5e12f348c510dc6454c9650214175aff50dc0d8a9bea112ee9f777d3b", "ja": "だ、大丈夫です！　ありさ、まだまだ歩けます！\n{$P$}さんに、迷惑はかけません！", "zh": "没、没事的！亚利沙还走得动！\n不能给{$P$}先生添麻烦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1007_p", "source_sha256": "36cc8adf897e64caeda40d16970c81eae286749950cccd12ea598c31cdf19a95", "ja": "なんだか様子がおかしいな……。そういえば、\nさっきから全然目を合わせようとしないし……。", "zh": "你好像不太对劲……而且，\n你从刚才就完全不和我四目相交……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "1bc890a63129e3b4957e66b6f31104dfba14b5617e5c58b1e2ffffb6ce307650", "ja": "いえっ、そんなコトありません！　ありさは、\nアイドルちゃんの写真に目を奪われているだけですっ！", "zh": "没有！没这回事！亚利沙只是\n舍不得将目光移开偶像宝贝的照片而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "eb83b2b6e6989926ebc358109fb19b5e70ca2a2398ad9725a63c5d5a386daf88", "ja": "ささ、{$P$}さん！\n早く山を下りてしまいましょう！", "zh": "好了好了，{$P$}先生！\n我们快点下山吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1010_p", "source_sha256": "13495f58f912b0f545704b02291afa64b722c45ef258054b24d16593a8e89d9f", "ja": "もしかして、何かあったのか？　悩みがあるなら、\n遠慮せず相談してほしいんだけど……。", "zh": "难道是发生了什么事吗？有烦恼的话，\n希望你别客气，大方找我商量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "2324df6a89a3c7718e2710bce8f58f30af80d316a601f07a7a9f701a6e73ccff", "ja": "いえ、そういうワケではないんですケド……\nううっ、{$P$}さんの視線が痛い！", "zh": "呃不，也不是什么烦恼……\n呜呜！{$P$}先生的视线真刺人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "c18511eb857dc791bbeb1b2abe0c16b7ddabd7bfcfab74f72d52bd097ffa0a28", "ja": "わ、わかりました……ありさ、全部お話しします！\nえーっと、実は……。", "zh": "好、好吧……亚利沙就全招了！\n那个，其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1013_p", "source_sha256": "040b3af9e94f249a9e32e27f390d26eb59471f46977296ee8f484c8d2835c6ae", "ja": "うん、実は？", "zh": "嗯，其实？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "2739ddc51b5007aa6e02030b7322afff1ec1cdd5445d16ffd04c4b01e6aafc3b", "ja": "ありさ、初詣の時に\nちょっと真面目なお願いごとをしたので……。", "zh": "亚利沙在年初参拜的时候，\n许了一个有点认真的愿望……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "fc68cfa9f0ffa8d033d5737c44813da1bc5b7b4c07f72a22e7befc3aa30cd488", "ja": "{$P$}さんに、\nそれを聞かれていたと思うと……ううう。", "zh": "一想到{$P$}先生\n听见了那个愿望，亚利沙就……呜呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c2e39d8fcef72cd3f084a2b92bf0a3f144e6141998cae34537e69d2f607e86c1", "ja": "それで恥ずかしくなって、\n俺の顔を見られなかったのか。大げさだな、亜利沙は。", "zh": "你是因此觉得害羞，才不敢看我啊。\n太夸张啰，亚利沙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "1a37d2bfee5d852a77b39aadde94c539cc3b56a9945ae61961249fee1941e4d2", "ja": "そんなコトありませんよ！　だってだって、ありさが\n今年は、もっとすごいアイドルになりたいとか……！", "zh": "哪有夸张！因为因为，亚利沙许的愿可是，\n今年要成为更厉害的偶像……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6c8155b1762c99035f3628efd210d94c29f492f0eeba6c19612fc0cee792b4bc", "ja": "なるほど、そんな内容だったのか。\nすごく、いい願い事だと思うけどな。", "zh": "原来是这种愿望啊，\n我觉得非常好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "d6b08a3d30a4f5e003bb8393add0783e16a43465cff1257a483187de0abb2616", "ja": "え？　……って、{$P$}さん！\nありさのお願いごと、聞こえてなかったんですか！？", "zh": "咦……？啊，{$P$}先生！\n原来你没听到亚利沙许什么愿吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1020_p", "source_sha256": "9af4cede7cfd5fe700721abe6df438d8577499daf35271a199b94beccde96127", "ja": "うん。でも、今聞いてしまったけど……。", "zh": "嗯，不过，刚才听到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "2956c3a63c0cc923a2ff6cf2ad684379fe84b579d5e1ed3627b24176e5996cf1", "ja": "ふぉぉぉ……！　ありさ一生の不覚です～！？\n今の話は、ナシで！　ナシでお願いします！", "zh": "唔喔喔喔……！这是亚利沙这辈子最大的错误～！！\n刚才当我没说！拜托你当作没听到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f34561cbecf4ad0308aa0de44290c89df14a1dcb6f9d2f739eb8d2b296ed7afb", "ja": "心配しなくても、俺は亜利沙のプロデューサーだから。\nアイドルの願い事を笑ったりしないよ。", "zh": "没什么好担心的，我可是亚利沙的制作人，\n我才不会嘲笑偶像许的愿望呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e0a9247ed5dbfbe66c54df8f289f77c4fd916cac5a9f29682fbfdad83ffe8de0", "ja": "亜利沙に、アイドルとしての願い事があるなら、\n俺はそれを叶える手伝いをするだけだよ。", "zh": "亚利沙既然有做为偶像的愿景，\n那我就会帮助你实现它。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "80c43b994be2bb11283f15a6903013172a934381757315084bab5b10d47dc4e4", "ja": "{$P$}さん……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1025_p", "source_sha256": "7cb56ee26621571052dec285e87970ebc6af167d1f3bf310703d7fc40abc2153", "ja": "あらためて、今年も1年よろしくな。亜利沙。", "zh": "今年一整年，再次请你多多指教啦，亚利沙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "2d506c51ad7c1dd857fe5281ebab368531d7dfb5956df8936d44039af3045df1", "ja": "はい……！　ありさのほうこそ！\nよろしくお願いします、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "好的……！亚利沙才是！\n请你多多指教了，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0093_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "ccbe9250ec9bc800adf650d0017724dfe6825c05ed98dc68fbfb5e308a2b4cc0", "ja": "ありさは今年も、アイドルのてっぺん目指して\nがんばりますね！　えへへ……♪", "zh": "亚利沙今年也要朝顶尖偶像\n这个目标迈进！嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
